      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَعْضِهَةٌ</span></b>  A woman <i>seeking,</i> or <i>demanding, enchantment:</i> hence the trad., ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَعَنَ ٱللّٰهُ العَاضِهَةَ</span></b> 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَالمُسْتَعْضِهَةَ</span> [<i>May God curse her who enchants
and her who seeks,</i> or <i>demands, enchantment</i>].
(TA.)

